# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in your key.
# Get a free Gemini API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# Local (VS Code / PyCharm / JupyterLab): the notebooks load this file
# automatically via python-dotenv -- nothing else to configure.
#
# Google Colab: this file is not used. Instead, either paste your key
# directly into the "GEMINI_API_KEY" setup cell, or (recommended) add it
# once as a Colab secret named GEMINI_API_KEY (key icon in the left
# sidebar) and the same setup cell will pick it up automatically.

GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
